# Brewfile.home — personal-machine Homebrew extras.
#
# Auto-bundled only on machines that answered home=true at `chezmoi init`, via
# the run_onchange_after_25-brew-home hook. The `home` opt-in defaults to false,
# so work/servers/CI/Coder never install these.
#
# The main Brewfile stays common + headless-safe (and un-templated); anything
# that only personal boxes should get lives here. Distinct from Brewfile.optional
# (opt-in-by-hand desktop extras).

# Casks
cask "tailscale-app"
